  "lead": [
   "In the Bible a kingdom is not mainly a piece of land. It is a reign: God being King and his will being done. Jesus’ first preaching in Mark is that this reign has come near. This study teaches one habit. Before you decide what a kingdom saying means, listen for its tense."
  ],
